  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408814/description_70c047dc-1693-4496-aa2c-ae1e71c1de8a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252fgames%252fminecraft-server-hosting%252f1408814%252fliminal-spaces-meultis-backrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408814/description_a1c29b72-ee5a-44f3-b5d5-6c6cd1cbb5b9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></a><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><br><br><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><br><br>這個模組包支援單人或多人遊玩，為您的遊戲引入了「後室」元素。要進入後室，您必須用沙子或礫石覆蓋自己。請小心，這些被稱為「後室」的無限走廊中潛伏著各種實體……<br>一旦進入後室，您需要盡快找到出口。一條走廊可能通向一扇門，一扇門可能通向一個或多個房間，甚至是出口……也可能不是。請記住，後室（至少在這個模組包中的後室）由多個不同的層級組成，每個層級都有獨特的材料和實體。<br>此模組包還整合了一個心理健康系統，需要定期檢查其狀態。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>如果您不知道如何離開，請查看您的鍵位配置；其中一個鍵會提供有關後室的信息……</strong><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408814/description_49736f99-e2a4-4961-be44-e07e3856fbdf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"><br><br><strong>・第 0 層</strong><br><strong>・第 2 層</strong><br><strong>・第 1 層</strong><br><strong>・第 54 層（樓梯）</strong><br><strong>・第 37 層（泳池）</strong><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408814/description_75820797-beb5-40f7-a6b8-bc7b412b9977.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"113\"><br><br><strong>・嚎叫者</strong><br><strong>・微笑者</strong><br><strong>・死鼠</strong><br><strong>・奪皮者</strong></p>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408814/description_67e88327-43de-47e8-9c00-1fb4e826a801.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"340\"></h1>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">臨界空間 - (Meulti 的後室) by CreepyGaming | @ : Spin_o</span></strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/vmVAnaF7q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408814/description_230010de-e672-48a8-b835-2f3c9e3de908.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-JyWQHxi7gqdzjSCoZRm0w\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1408814/description_ea663826-5607-4402-9f73-38d92d0ca605.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>",
